          <div class="frplus-faq-body" style="display:none;padding:14px 18px;font-size:0.84rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color);background:var(--bg-primary);">
            Refunds are handled by Roblox's own gamepass refund policy. If you're having trouble or believe you were charged in error, join our Discord and we'll do our best to help.
