      <div class="legal-body">

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>1. Overview</h2>
          <p>FR Plus is the official premium upgrade for the Friends Remover browser extension. It is purchased as a <strong>one-time 115 Robux payment</strong> through the Roblox Game Pass system and unlocks the full suite of Friends Remover features permanently — there are no renewals or recurring charges.</p>
          <p>This policy governs the FR Plus purchase offered by Friends Remover. By purchasing FR Plus, you agree to the terms outlined below.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>2. Pricing &amp; Billing</h2>
          <p>FR Plus is priced at a <strong>one-time payment of 115 Robux</strong>, processed entirely through Roblox's Game Pass platform. Robux is Roblox's virtual currency, purchased with real-world money. By purchasing, you acknowledge that your Robux has real monetary value.</p>
          <p>This is a single, non-recurring purchase — Roblox will not charge you again for FR Plus. Friends Remover does not directly handle, process, or store any payment or billing information; all transactions are managed by Roblox.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>3. What's Included</h2>
          <p>Purchasing FR Plus grants permanent access to the following features:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>⚡ Ultra-Fast Removal Speeds</strong> — Quick (450ms), Fast (250ms), and Ultra-Fast (50ms) modes</li>
            <li><strong>📅 Scheduled Removals</strong> — Automatically remove friends at a set date and time</li>
            <li><strong>🚫 Block Mode</strong> — Auto-block users immediately after removal</li>
            <li><strong>📌 Unlimited Pins</strong> — Pin unlimited friends to the top of your list</li>
            <li><strong>📜 Unlimited Removal History</strong> — Full removal history with no entry cap (free users capped at 750)</li>
            <li><strong>🚀 Faster Background Polling</strong> — Background checks run up to 2 minutes faster than the free tier</li>
            <li><strong>🎨 Exclusive Themes</strong> — Special visual themes only available to FR Plus members</li>
            <li><strong>🧪 Early Beta Access</strong> — Try new features before they're released to all users</li>
            <li><strong>⚙️ Exclusive Plus Settings</strong> — A dedicated settings panel with Plus-only controls</li>
            <li><strong>🏷️ FR Plus Badge</strong> — A special badge displayed on your Friends Remover profile</li>
            <li><strong>✨ Plus Branding</strong> — Exclusive FR Plus branding throughout the extension</li>
            <li><strong>👥 Exclusive Group Rank</strong> — A special rank in the <a href="https://www.roblox.com/communities/129697973/Friends-Remover-Official" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Friends Remover Official</a> Roblox group</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Features may be added, adjusted, or updated over time. Major changes will be communicated in advance.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>4. Eligibility &amp; Activation</h2>
          <p>To use FR Plus, you must have an active Roblox account that is not banned, and you must be logged into Roblox in your browser for FR Plus to activate and be verified.</p>
          <p>FR Plus is verified automatically by checking your Roblox game pass inventory. Activation is typically instant but may take a few minutes in some cases.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>5. Ownership</h2>
          <p>FR Plus is a one-time purchase, not a subscription — there is nothing to cancel and no recurring billing period. Once purchased, FR Plus remains active on your Roblox account permanently.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>6. Refunds</h2>
          <p>All FR Plus purchases are processed through Roblox and are subject to Roblox's own refund policies. Friends Remover does not issue refunds directly.</p>
          <p>If you believe you were charged in error, please contact Roblox Support at <a href="https://www.roblox.com/support" target="_blank" rel="noopener">roblox.com/support</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>7. Extension Removal from Browser Platforms</h2>
          <p>From time to time, browser extension stores (such as the Chrome Web Store or Firefox Add-ons) may remove or delist extensions for policy reviews, compliance updates, or other platform-level reasons outside of our control.</p>
          <p>In the event that Friends Remover is removed from any browser platform:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>No refunds will be issued for FR Plus purchases as a result of the extension being delisted or removed from any browser extension store.</li>
            <li>We commit to re-uploading the extension to the affected platform as promptly as possible following any removal.</li>
            <li>During any period of unavailability, your FR Plus purchase remains valid and your access will be fully restored as soon as the extension is back on the platform.</li>
            <li>We will communicate any removal and the expected resolution timeline through our website at <a href="https://friendsremover.xyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">friendsremover.xyz</a> and through our <a href="https://www.roblox.com/communities/129697973/Friends-Remover-Official" target="_blank" rel="noopener">official Roblox group</a>.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>By subscribing, you acknowledge and accept that temporary platform-level unavailability does not constitute grounds for a refund.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>8. Account &amp; Transferability</h2>
          <p>FR Plus is bound to the specific Roblox account used at the time of purchase. It is non-transferable and cannot be shared, gifted, or moved to another Roblox account.</p>
          <p>FR Plus will be recognized on any device or browser profile where you are logged into the same Roblox account.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>9. Service Availability</h2>
          <p>Friends Remover and FR Plus are provided on an "as-is" basis. We strive for high availability but cannot guarantee uninterrupted service at all times.</p>
          <p>Cloud-dependent features (such as history sync and FR Plus verification) rely on the Friends Remover service being online. Local features will continue to work regardless. We are not liable for disruptions caused by changes to Roblox's platform, API, or policies.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We reserve the right to update this policy at any time. Continued use of FR Plus after an update constitutes acceptance of the revised policy. We will notify users of significant changes through the extension or on our website.</p>
        </section>

